{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00544","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 顺和 · 源光裕","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 顺和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方丘既膳，嘉飨载谧。\n齐敬毕诚，陶匏贵质。\n秀毕丰荐，芳俎盈实。\n永永福流，其昇如日。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"源光裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}